      "message": "Tested with patchset 6:\nDeployed on a Yosemite4 BMC and drove real firmware updates of a Sentinel Dome\nBIC (Slot 1) over MCTP through Software.Update.StartUpdate. Each successful\nupdate produced, in the Redfish EventLog, Update.1.2.TargetDetermined,\nTransferringToComponent, VerifyingAtComponent, InstallingOnComponent and\nUpdateSuccessful, with IMAGE_IDENTIFIER \u003d the PackageVersionString and\nTARGET_NAME \u003d the updated FirmwareInventory entry.\nA package for another device class gave Update.1.2.UpdateNotApplicable and a\nnon-PLDM file gave Update.1.2.VerificationFailed.",
